msgid "Window class configuration"
msgstr "Configuração por classe de janela"

msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">Overriding default parameters for the specified WindowClass. Format:</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">WindowClass:SpecialFlag,SpecialFlag...:shortname=value,shortname=value...</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">pin - </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">docked window with this flag will displace another if their positions are equal.</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">left,right,top,bottom</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\"> - you can use one them to explicitly set the initial position.</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">auto</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\"> - automatically makes a window docked. Krohnkite version &gt;=0.9.9.1</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">You can only write down the parameters you want to change. You can see the short name of the parameter if you hover over any default parameter above.</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">Examples:</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">1. if Elisa switches to dock it will have higher priority, top dock position and 10% of screen height </span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">org.kde.elisa</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">:pin,top:hh=10</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">2. Conky automatic docking</span></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:12pt;\">Conky:</span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">auto</span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:12pt;\">:</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Valores próprios para uma classe de janela. Formato:</p><p><b>ClasseDaJanela:Marca,Marca…:nomecurto=valor,nomecurto=valor…</b></p><p><b>pin</b> — na mesma posição, a janela com esta marca tira a outra do lugar.</p><p><b>left,right,top,bottom</b> — define a posição inicial.</p><p><b>auto</b> — a janela vai para a doca sozinha.</p><p>Escreva só o que quer mudar. O nome curto de cada valor aparece ao passar o mouse sobre ele acima.</p><p>Exemplos:</p><p>1. o Elisa na doca com prioridade, em cima e com 10% da altura da tela:</p><p>org.kde.elisa<b>:pin,top:hh=10</b></p><p>2. o Conky vai para a doca sozinho:</p><p>Conky:<b>auto</b>:</p></body></html>"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opções"

msgid "Window Layer"
msgstr "Camada das janelas"

msgid "Tiled"
msgstr "Lado a lado"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

msgid "Above"
msgstr "Acima"

msgid "Float  "
msgstr "Flutuantes  "

msgid "The Sole Window properties"
msgstr "Quando há uma janela só"

msgid "Width "
msgstr "Largura "

msgid "No Borders"
msgstr "Sem bordas"

msgid "No Gaps"
msgstr "Sem espaços"

msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Avisos"

msgid "<html><head/><body><p>Set the time (in milliseconds) for how long a pop-up notification will remain visible before it automatically disappears. A value of 0 will disable notifications.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Quanto tempo (em milissegundos) o aviso fica na tela antes de sumir. 0 desliga os avisos.</p></body></html>"

msgid "Duration  "
msgstr "Duração  "

msgid "All tiled windows will have no borders. Borders will be added back if window become float."
msgstr "As janelas lado a lado ficam sem borda; a borda volta quando a janela flutua."

msgid "Use separate layouts for each Activity"
msgstr "Um layout para cada atividade"

msgid "Use separate layouts for each Desktop"
msgstr "Um layout para cada área de trabalho"

msgid "Remove borders of tiled windows"
msgstr "Tirar a borda das janelas lado a lado"

msgid "Always preserve the tiling status of a window upon dragging"
msgstr "Manter o estado da janela (lado a lado ou flutuante) ao arrastar"

msgid "Prevent windows from minimizing (experimental)"
msgstr "Impedir que as janelas minimizem (experimental)"

msgid "Prevent window from protruding from its screen"
msgstr "Impedir que a janela passe da borda da tela"

msgid "<html><head/><body><p>If enabled, all windows with property skipPager=true become floating. You can create KDE Window Rule and force  skipPager=true.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Ligado: toda janela com skipPager=true flutua. Dá para forçar skipPager=true com uma regra de janela do KDE.</p></body></html>"

msgid "Make the window float if its property: skipPager=true (HACK)"
msgstr "Flutuar a janela com skipPager=true (gambiarra)"

msgid "Log"
msgstr "Registro"

msgid "Use this option to debug the script or submit detailed bug report."
msgstr "Para depurar o script ou mandar um relato de erro detalhado."

msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Registro"

msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">logs all windows that Krohnkite indexes and manages</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>registra todas as janelas que o motor indexa e controla</p></body></html>"

msgid "Added new windows"
msgstr "Janelas novas adicionadas"

msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">logs all windows that Krohnkite does not manage for many reasons: service, dialog, etc.</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>registra as janelas que o motor não controla (serviço, diálogo etc.)</p></body></html>"

msgid "Filtered new windows"
msgstr "Janelas novas filtradas"

msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">logs all windows that Krohkite could manage if not for the filters in the configuration</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>registra as janelas que o motor controlaria se não fossem os filtros da configuração</p></body></html>"

msgid "Unmanaged new windows"
msgstr "Janelas novas não controladas"

msgid "<html><head/><body><h4 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:medium; font-weight:700;\">Filtering log modules</span></h4><p>the group of the log modules checkbox enables the entire group of log modules at once and in order to include only certain modules there is a line-edit nearby. Examples:</p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\"><li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">1,4-</span> - enable only the first and from the fourth to the last module</li><li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">!1,4-6</span> - the exclamation mark at the beginning turns on the exclude mode, so this line will enable all modules except 1 and from 4 to 6. <span style=\" font-family:'Hack';\">!</span> - the exclamation mark you can use only once in the beginning, to enable the exclude mode.</li></ul></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><h4>Filtrar os módulos do registro</h4><p>A caixa de cada grupo liga o grupo inteiro; para só alguns módulos, use o campo ao lado. Exemplos:</p><ul><li><tt>1,4-</tt> — só o primeiro e do quarto ao último</li><li><tt>!1,4-6</tt> — a exclamação no começo inverte: todos menos o 1 e do 4 ao 6 (use a <tt>!</tt> só uma vez, no começo).</li></ul></body></html>"

msgid "filter log modules popup tooltip <<<hover me>>>"
msgstr "filtro dos módulos do registro <<<passe o mouse>>>"

msgid "<html><head/><body><h5 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">Workspace signals log modules</span></h5><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. screensChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. virtualScreenGeometryChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. currentActivityChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. currentDesktopChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. windowAdded</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">6. windowActivated</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">7. windowRemoved</span></p><p><br/></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><b>Módulos dos sinais da área de trabalho</b></p><p>1. screensChanged</p><p>2. virtualScreenGeometryChanged</p><p>3. currentActivityChanged</p><p>4. currentDesktopChanged</p><p>5. windowAdded</p><p>6. windowActivated</p><p>7. windowRemoved</p></body></html>"

msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">All other log modules</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. shortcut</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. arrangeScreen</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. printConfig</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. setTimeout</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. window</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><b>Outros módulos do registro</b></p><p>1. shortcut</p><p>2. arrangeScreen</p><p>3. printConfig</p><p>4. setTimeout</p><p>5. window</p></body></html>"

msgid "Workspace signals"
msgstr "Sinais da área de trabalho"

msgid "Window signals     "
msgstr "Sinais das janelas     "

msgid "<html><head/><body><h5 style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">Window signals log modules</span></h5><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">1. activitiesChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">2. bufferGeometryChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">3. desktopsChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">4. fullScreenChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">5. interactiveMoveResizeStepped</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">6. maximizedAboutToChange</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">7. minimizedChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">8. moveResizedChanged</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">9. outputChanged</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><b>Módulos dos sinais das janelas</b></p><p>1. activitiesChanged</p><p>2. bufferGeometryChanged</p><p>3. desktopsChanged</p><p>4. fullScreenChanged</p><p>5. interactiveMoveResizeStepped</p><p>6. maximizedAboutToChange</p><p>7. minimizedChanged</p><p>8. moveResizedChanged</p><p>9. outputChanged</p></body></html>"

msgid "Other                       "
msgstr "Outros                       "

msgid "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">Also, in addition to the fact that you can include only the modules you need, you can enable </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">Filter</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> checkbox and use other filters in filter line edit:</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">winclass</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">Examples:</span></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">winclass=[konsole]</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\"/><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\">- some modules may be filtered by a window class, so this logs modules will show only windows with class that contains </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">konsole</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> word.</span></p><p><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt;\">- </span><span style=\" font-family:'Hack'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;\">!winclass=org.kde.elisa:org.kde.ruler</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt;\"> -Exclude Elisa and Kruler from log output</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Além de escolher os módulos, você pode ligar a caixa <tt>Filtro</tt> e usar estes filtros no campo:</p><p>- <b>winclass</b></p><p>Exemplos:</p><p><tt>- <b>winclass=[konsole]</b></tt> — módulos que filtram pela classe da janela mostram só as que têm <tt>konsole</tt> na classe.</p><p><tt>- <b>!winclass=org.kde.elisa:org.kde.ruler</b></tt> — tira o Elisa e o KRuler do registro.</p></body></html>"

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filtro"

msgid "Tiling on in this environment (iRiS or Plasma)"
msgstr "Tiling ligado neste ambiente (iRiS ou Plasma)"

msgid "On: windows become columns and the tiling takes Meta+arrows and the title bar buttons. Off: everything goes back to KDE. Each environment (iRiS and Plasma) keeps its own choice."
msgstr "Ligado: as janelas viram colunas e o tiling fica com as Meta+setas e os botões da barra de título. Desligado: tudo volta para o KDE. Cada ambiente (iRiS e Plasma) guarda a sua escolha."
